@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA

' ==== note（コメント）: 控えめなグレー ====
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  BorderColor #BDBDBD
  FontColor #757575
}

' ==== actor（外部）: グレー ====
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #E0E0E0
  BorderColor #757575
  FontColor #424242
}

' ==== database / table: グレー ====
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #E0E0E0
  BorderColor #757575
  FontColor #424242
}

' ==== queue: グレー ====
skinparam queue {
  BackgroundColor #E0E0E0
  BorderColor #757575
  FontColor #424242
}

' ==== participant デフォルト: Application（青） ====
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  BorderColor #1565C0
  FontColor #0D47A1
}

actor User

' Presentation（Controller）: オレンジ
participant SignupRestApi as Controller #FFE0B2

' Application（Command）: デフォルトの青
participant SignupCommand as Command

' Domain（DomainModel）: 緑
participant "User (Domain)" as DomainModel #C8E6C9
participant WelcomeEmail #C8E6C9
participant WelcomeSlackNotification #C8E6C9

' Infrastructure（Repo）: 紫
participant UserRepository as Repo #E1BEE7
participant KafkaEventPublisher as Kafka #E1BEE7

' Database / Queue: グレー
database UserTable
queue KafkaTopic

User -> Controller: POST /auth/signup\n(email, password)
Controller -> Command: execute(input)

Command -> Repo: existsByEmail(email)
Repo --> Command: false

Command -> DomainModel: User.signup(email, password)
note right: UserSignedUpEvent を登録
DomainModel --> Command: user

Command -> Repo: insert(user)
Repo -> UserTable: INSERT user
UserTable --> Repo

Command -> Kafka: publishAllDomainEvents(user.getDomainEvents())
Kafka -> KafkaTopic: UserSignedUpEvent

Command -> WelcomeEmail: create(user)
WelcomeEmail --> Command: SendEmailCommandEventInput
Command -> Kafka: publishCommandEvent(welcomeEmail)
Kafka -> KafkaTopic: SendEmailCommandEvent

Command -> WelcomeSlackNotification: create(user)
WelcomeSlackNotification --> Command: SendSlackNotificationCommandEventInput
Command -> Kafka: publishCommandEvent(welcomeSlack)
Kafka -> KafkaTopic: SendSlackNotificationCommandEvent

Command --> Controller: Output
Controller --> User: 201 Created
@enduml
